+3. ``k0_run_h``: the same 100 units at h (h's own module, 8956c7b6..., code 5e19c4b6's), six workers, into state/k0/h:
+   the census's own unit timings at h for its cost projection, and the unit the third clause chooses;
+4. ``k0_compare_h``: compare_07b.py ``calls`` against 07a's census into out/k0/compare_k0_h_calls.json (descriptive: U1's
+   classing on those units, before the census);
